  m_Name: FIshermanDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  dialogue:
  - Glad you're moving again
  - You were in a pretty rough shape when I found you
  - Am I correct in assuming this sword and book are yours?
  - I have never seen a sword so fine, but I am not one to care for such weapons.
  - If you are a warrior here to fight, I must warn you.
  - 'The road ahead has been teeming with creatures since you showed up. '
  - 'May <color=red>Merlin</color> guide you. '
  - "Right Mouse Button or \nRight Bumper to cast"
